dialogs
1	For a hardy fellow like me, hardy POKéMON are the best.Offense is the best defense! A relentless attack is the ultimate!But that's not what I wanted to chat about.Every so often a really cute lady swings by here.She says that she can tell what POKéMON are thinking.I don't know about that part, but she is really cute.Huh? Why are you looking at me like that?
2	I wonder what sort of nature a POKéMON would have if it favored enfeebling its opponents and chipping away slowly.I'd be surprised if it was a LAX nature.But, nah, that can't be right.
3	Hmm…It appears that the nature of POKéMON and the moves that they have been taught are the keys to battle here.To be more precise, it's how well the moves match the nature of the POKéMON.If your POKéMON is in trouble and unable to live up to its potential, you may need to examine how well its moves match its nature.
4	My POKéMON is usually very docile.But when it's in a BATTLE HALL, it sometimes seems to become transformed into something wicked!It becomes totally intimidating. It's shocking, even.
