msgbox	Hmm…It appears that the nature of POKéMON and the moves that they have been taught are the keys to battle here.To be more precise, it's how well the moves match the nature of the POKéMON.If your POKéMON is in trouble and unable to live up to its potential, you may need to examine how well its moves match its nature.
end
= BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_EventScript_Maniac
msgbox	I wonder what sort of nature a POKéMON would have if it favored enfeebling its opponents and chipping away slowly.I'd be surprised if it was a LAX nature.But, nah, that can't be right.
end
